WEBVTT

00:01.210 --> 00:02.960
<i>The Great Race of Oban</i>

00:03.130 --> 00:06.220
<i>finally yielded my successor,
the new Avatar</i>

00:06.340 --> 00:09.800
<i>to steer Oban
for the next 10,000 years.</i>

00:09.970 --> 00:12.680
<i>But young Molly chose
to rescue her friend Aikka</i>

00:12.850 --> 00:15.020
<i>rather than accept the crown.</i>

00:15.180 --> 00:18.810
<i>A heartfelt decision,
but one of grave consequences.</i>

00:19.140 --> 00:21.940
<i>The end of my 10,000 year reign
broke the spell</i>

00:22.150 --> 00:24.400
<i>that held the terrible Canaletto.</i>

00:24.820 --> 00:26.900
<i>Without an Avatar in place,</i>

00:27.070 --> 00:30.740
<i>no one can stop him,
not even I.</i>

01:41.180 --> 01:42.230
Hang on, Molly.

01:45.310 --> 01:47.020
There's a temple still standing.

01:47.610 --> 01:48.690
Let's head for it.

02:54.220 --> 02:56.180
Everything is gone.

02:56.340 --> 03:00.600
The temples,
the trees, the animals.

03:00.810 --> 03:02.720
We're still here.

03:02.970 --> 03:04.270
There's hope.

03:05.020 --> 03:06.690
Everyone's gone.

03:06.900 --> 03:09.650
Satis, the other pilots...

03:10.110 --> 03:11.110
and even...

03:15.280 --> 03:17.110
...even Aikka.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.910
Molly, let go.

03:19.120 --> 03:21.080
It's not your fault.

03:21.700 --> 03:22.910
It is, Jordan.

03:23.120 --> 03:24.790
It's completely my fault.

03:25.080 --> 03:27.170
Mine and no one else's.

03:29.460 --> 03:31.090
You thought you were right.

03:31.250 --> 03:32.130
No one

03:32.340 --> 03:35.170
put as much of their heart
and soul in this race as you did.

03:47.480 --> 03:48.690
Give me a hand, will ya?

03:48.980 --> 03:50.400
This side's worse.

04:09.040 --> 04:11.330
<i>Attempting secure connection.</i>

04:17.260 --> 04:18.840
<i>Connection successful.</i>

04:24.680 --> 04:27.390
Mr. President, I'm so glad
to reach you.

04:27.600 --> 04:28.940
There is much I have to tell you.

04:31.150 --> 04:31.940
Mr. President?

04:32.360 --> 04:34.480
Can you hear me?
It's Don Wei.

04:35.230 --> 04:36.940
<i>The Grog Armada has regrouped.</i>

04:37.110 --> 04:38.950
All units fall back immediately.

04:39.320 --> 04:41.620
I repeat, fall back immediately.

04:43.490 --> 04:45.620
Mr. President,
what's happening?

04:50.580 --> 04:52.460
Earth Defense One
to Central Command.

04:52.630 --> 04:55.800
Crog cruisers spotted off Venus.
Awaiting your instructions.

04:56.460 --> 04:58.970
Earth Defense Three,
we've got more over here.

04:59.170 --> 05:00.590
Three, no eight.

05:00.930 --> 05:03.640
Wait, eleven!
They're coming from everywhere!

05:04.260 --> 05:06.180
It's an entire Armada!

05:06.600 --> 05:08.980
Where's our fleet?
We need help!

05:09.680 --> 05:10.640
Mr. President?

05:15.320 --> 05:17.070
I had no choice.

05:17.480 --> 05:20.950
These creatures,
you can't trust them.

05:24.030 --> 05:25.950
Did you get
your connection, sir?

05:26.450 --> 05:28.080
No, no, I...

05:28.250 --> 05:30.870
...couldn't get through.
It must be the storm.

05:58.780 --> 06:00.780
-It can't be.
-Huh? What?

06:01.570 --> 06:02.490
Yes, it's him.

06:04.240 --> 06:07.280
Molly, what are you talking about?
It's just the wind.

06:08.790 --> 06:10.120
Molly, come back here!

06:21.170 --> 06:22.090
Oh, G'dar...

06:25.840 --> 06:27.180
But where is...

06:34.020 --> 06:35.150
Aikka, no!

06:44.650 --> 06:46.240
<i>Oh, Aikka...</i>

06:47.030 --> 06:49.080
I thought I'd lost you.

06:57.540 --> 06:58.840
How is he?

06:59.000 --> 07:01.710
He'll be fine,
but he needs a lot of rest.

07:01.880 --> 07:02.840
Poor kid.

07:03.010 --> 07:04.300
He was completely dehydrated.

07:05.130 --> 07:06.180
He's very lucky.

07:28.740 --> 07:30.740
Aikka, you have to rest.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.830
There is no time for rest.

07:34.330 --> 07:35.500
We must hurry,

07:35.660 --> 07:38.420
or Canaletto will seize
the powers of the Avatar.

07:38.580 --> 07:40.750
I... I don't understand
what you mean.

07:50.800 --> 07:52.760
Ah, wake up, G'dar!

07:53.010 --> 07:54.020
Wake up!

08:06.650 --> 08:08.990
<i>After G'dar
rescued me from my fall,</i>

08:09.160 --> 08:11.530
<i>I quickly headed back
to the Flying Temple.</i>

08:11.830 --> 08:13.950
<i>But something was
just not right.</i>

08:22.960 --> 08:26.630
<i>At first, I feared
Kross had won the last race.</i>

08:30.840 --> 08:31.720
Safis!

08:35.100 --> 08:38.640
<i>The truth was
much more insidious.</i>

08:57.790 --> 09:01.120
Don't move, you'll see.
We're going to be all right.

09:01.460 --> 09:03.250
Never mind me.

09:03.460 --> 09:05.210
My time is long overdue.

09:05.800 --> 09:09.380
But yours is just beginning.
You must save Oban.

09:09.840 --> 09:11.260
What can I do?

09:12.680 --> 09:16.310
I had to destroy the Pyramid
of Power from the Flying Temple

09:17.140 --> 09:20.980
to prevent Canaletto from stealing
the power of the Avatar.

09:21.900 --> 09:23.190
Canaletto?

09:25.400 --> 09:29.360
But there is a similar pyramid
in the Temple of the Heart.

09:29.740 --> 09:34.200
You must take Molly there
and crown her Avatar.

09:36.370 --> 09:37.490
Oh, Satis...

09:37.660 --> 09:40.000
There is little time left now.

09:40.160 --> 09:44.330
Canaletto must be headed there
at this very moment.

09:46.420 --> 09:49.050
If he takes over
the powers of the Avatar,

09:49.210 --> 09:51.930
no one will ever be able
to stop him.

09:52.180 --> 09:55.140
No one. The whole Galaxy
will be destroyed.

09:56.550 --> 09:58.810
Molly is our only hope.

09:59.930 --> 10:01.480
Hurry.

10:06.230 --> 10:07.320
Safis!

10:13.570 --> 10:16.320
This is why
I have come for you, Molly.

10:17.950 --> 10:20.620
I... I'm not sure
I can do this.

10:20.830 --> 10:22.960
I'm too young,
too inexperienced.

10:23.750 --> 10:26.380
Look at all the harm
I've caused.

10:27.540 --> 10:30.800
You did not destroy
the Flying Temple, Molly.

10:30.960 --> 10:33.800
It was Canaletto's evil magic.

10:33.970 --> 10:36.640
You are the only one
who can stop him now,

10:37.390 --> 10:38.600
whoever he is.

10:40.770 --> 10:43.890
Molly, you are the new Avatar.

10:44.480 --> 10:49.190
And I put my bow
and my sword at your service.

11:02.290 --> 11:03.870
I'll do it.

11:04.460 --> 11:06.040
I won't run away.

11:20.140 --> 11:21.010
How is she?

11:21.180 --> 11:23.060
The booster drives
are totally dead.

11:23.560 --> 11:25.890
But the Whizzing Arrow 3 will fly.

11:29.650 --> 11:31.270
Ready?

11:32.030 --> 11:33.570
Born ready.

11:34.070 --> 11:36.320
Let's teach that magician
a few new tricks.

11:37.780 --> 11:39.410
Then we're set.

11:48.750 --> 11:50.750
Eva, wait.

11:52.800 --> 11:54.760
Huh? Eva?

11:58.300 --> 12:00.470
Yes, Dad? What is it?

12:00.890 --> 12:02.510
What do you mean, Dad?

12:08.850 --> 12:10.020
<i>'Nun.</i>

12:10.190 --> 12:11.310
I love you.

12:14.860 --> 12:17.240
You boys take good care
of my daughter.

12:25.500 --> 12:27.330
You've got to be kidding me.

12:28.250 --> 12:30.500
Molly, we must go.

12:58.650 --> 13:01.110
Don't worry, Dad.
I'll come back to you,

13:01.910 --> 13:03.660
one way or another.

13:29.100 --> 13:31.140
So, what should I call you now?

13:32.020 --> 13:34.730
Eva? Molly? Your Lordship?

13:35.690 --> 13:36.940
Whatever you like best.

13:37.820 --> 13:38.900
OK, Molly.

13:39.070 --> 13:42.570
But you're gonna have a lot
of explaining to do when we get back.

13:45.910 --> 13:47.870
I look forward to that.

14:03.630 --> 14:04.590
We've got company.

14:32.580 --> 14:34.080
What do you want with us?

15:03.900 --> 15:06.570
One wrong blink
and you're going down, pal.

15:14.410 --> 15:15.960
Looks like we got here first.

15:23.920 --> 15:25.130
That's a good boy.

15:25.300 --> 15:28.220
Now stay there 'til we're done
and I'll bring you back a treat.

15:35.520 --> 15:38.100
This is it.
This is the Temple of the Heart.

16:04.710 --> 16:07.090
Molly, it's a trap!
We must flee immediately!

16:09.470 --> 16:12.220
I hope Canaletto paid you well
for this, you traitor!

16:17.440 --> 16:18.100
No!

16:37.660 --> 16:38.750
What is that thing?

16:45.170 --> 16:48.930
<i>Unsaka'|', nurama terrahobora!</i>

17:06.230 --> 17:07.110
Aikka!

17:29.670 --> 17:31.050
Head for the temple door, Molly!

17:38.890 --> 17:41.890
We'll have to crash-land at the top
of the stairs. It's the only way.

17:42.900 --> 17:44.110
Let's do it!

18:09.550 --> 18:11.300
Jordan, abandon ship!

18:20.060 --> 18:20.980
Molly!

18:27.900 --> 18:30.570
Run for the door. I'll hold them off
for as long as I can.

18:30.740 --> 18:31.900
Jordan, don't do that!

18:35.410 --> 18:36.280
Go, Molly, run!

18:39.120 --> 18:42.710
I may not be a prince,
but I care for you just as much.

18:49.170 --> 18:50.590
Molly, watch out!

20:26.390 --> 20:28.020
Hurry, inside.

20:53.250 --> 20:56.260
I guess 6 was
a good guy after all.

20:58.760 --> 21:01.010
And that could only mean
one thing.

21:05.350 --> 21:08.310
He's here already,
waiting for us.

21:09.100 --> 21:10.730
Canaletto is here.
